    {
      "id": "concept-drawing-five-point-star-failure",
      "kind": "concept",
      "promptEs": "dibujar · estrella · rumbo · abortar",
      "questionEn": "Why does the calm drawing guide turn into an emergency?",
      "answerEn": "The attempted five-point star drifts off course, so the instructional captions escalate from reassurance to panic and an abort order.",
      "noteEn": "A regular five-point star requires carefully chosen turns. The official title text jokes that the frustrated artist would rather abandon the troublesome 36-degree geometry entirely.",
